      "Confirmed: The Bellone heir, Leontuzzo, orders Texas to guard the minister Carracci at a banquet. Confirmed: Alberto Saluzzo wants control of the Cittanova platform, and his daughter Lappland openly declares war on him. Confirmed: Carracci is killed by a car bomb before the banquet, and the neutral official Rubio is targeted as well. Confirmed: Lavinia Falcone arrests Texas to keep her from being used as a pawn. Confirmed: Demetri, the Bellone Consigliere, is revealed as the true conspirator. Speculation (no source found yet): He is working to overthrow Signora Sicilia and crown Zaaro as Alpha.",
      "Confirmed: Texas offers to take the blame so the other famiglie focus on her. Disputed: the draft said Lappland, with Capone and Gambino, crashes a truck into the courthouse. The source says Capone and Gambino drive the truck into the courthouse, and Lappland surrenders, claiming to be Carracci's killer. Confirmed: Bernardo orders Texas to assassinate Giovanna during an opera. Confirmed: Alberto rehires the hitman Danbrown.",
      "Confirmed: A stage explosion starts a fight at the opera, and Texas and Giovanna fight. Confirmed: Texas escapes with help from a Sankta priest, later named as Agenir. Speculation (no source found yet): The Penguin Logistics girls are with her.",
      "Confirmed: Wallach and other Rossati betray Giovanna and fight her in a deadly duel. Confirmed: Sora and Texas interrupt it. Confirmed: Rubio becomes mayor, and during his inauguration broadcast he commits suicide with a pistol while the broadcast is still on. Speculation (no source found yet): He asks the hitman whether he truly wants to serve the families. Confirmed: Shaken by Rubio's speech, Danbrown turns on Alberto, who kills him. Speculation (no source found yet): Alberto gives Leontuzzo ten seconds to choose.",
      "Confirmed: An earthquake hits as Bernardo hijacks the Cittanova's engines. Speculation (no source found yet): Leontuzzo finds his father in a church and persuades him to stop the riot. Confirmed: Bernardo later takes poison. Confirmed: The Emperor and the other Wolf Beast Lords defeat Zaaro, who bows his head and vanishes into the air. Confirmed: The Signora comes to Volsinii and agrees to Leontuzzo's plan to reform Siracusa. Speculation (no source found yet): Texas asks that the Rossati be spared, and Lavinia is trusted to reform the judiciary.",
