      "Confirmed: Lee, Kroos, Liang, and the others defeat the Second Brother's shadow through a go match inside the painted world. Confirmed: Ling destroys the goblet by throwing it into the Catastrophe that destroyed the peak. Speculation (no source found yet): Shang leaves Shangshu, and Zheng prepares to retire. Speculation (no source found yet): The Grand Tutor and Leizi clean up the aftermath, and Liang is promoted. Confirmed: The Sui sisters are allowed to stay at Rhodes Island."
