      "Speculation (no source found yet): The True Lung learns of Bu Fan, a system tied to the First Originium, which could suppress Sui at the cost of the True Lung's life. He gives Wang twenty years to replace Sui. Later, Jie's writing knife is stolen, and she asks Jun to keep it from Wang. Jie enters the Tomb of Sui and disappears.",
      "Speculation (no source found yet): At the Sky Mirror Pavilion, the group confronts Chun, the Supervisor of the Sui Regulator. She is working with the Grand Commandant, who plans to use Jie's knife to alter the historical record and make Wei Yenwu the True Lung. When the doll reacts to a light shaped like Jie, the locked office opens, and the doll is confirmed to hold a sliver of Jie's life force. Ch'en then defeats Wei Yenwu in a sword duel.",
